WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.592 --> 00:00:04.488
Yes, that's right.

2
00:00:04.824 --> 00:00:11.376
Fathers' makeup takes less time than the mothers', and suits wrinkle less easily, so it's convenient to just wear it from home.

3
00:00:11.712 --> 00:00:18.024
If the suit fabric wrinkles very easily, you can change at the wedding hall instead, but most fathers just wear it from home.

4
00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:24.192
The tie can feel constricting, though, so it's fine to bring it and put it on after makeup and hair are done.

5
00:00:24.528 --> 00:00:30.624
A cape is used during makeup and styling, so nothing will get on the suit.

6
00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.768
It's fine to wear it from home.
